script/0690_room_BattleTower_Lobby.txt.68:
Where the talents of Trainers
are put to the test!{be01}
Welcome to the Battle Tower!{be01}
I am your guide to the Single
Battle Rooms.

script/0690_room_BattleTower_Lobby.txt.70:
The Battle Tower’s Single Battle
Rooms are facilities for conducting{be00}
Single Battles with three Pokémon.{be01}
There are many Single Battle Rooms
in the Battle Tower for team battles.{be01}
In each of the Single Battle Rooms,
seven Trainers await your challenge.{be01}
If you manage to defeat all seven,
you will earn Battle Points.{be01}
If you want to interrupt your
challenge, please save the game.{be01}
If you don’t save before interrupting,
you will be disqualified.

script/0690_room_BattleTower_Lobby.txt.72:
Excuse me!{be01}
You don’t have three eligible Pokémon.{be01}
You must have three different Pokémon
of Level 50 or less to enter.{be01}
They also must be holding different
kinds of items.{be01}
Eggs{0100:1} ineligible.{be01}
Please come see me when you are ready.

